{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf7a DRUNK &amp; DAMNED</strong><br>The Wildest Medieval Cooking Brawl!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drunk &amp; Damned</strong> is a hilarious medieval cooking game where <strong>2\u20138</strong> players team up in chaotic <strong>co-op</strong>,<br>cook, brawl, and compete against rival taverns for beer-soaked glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two rival taverns.<br>Two chaotic kitchens.<br>And way too much ale. \ud83c\udf7b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your beards, swing your pans, and show everyone your crew can serve the meatiest, messiest meals in the kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf57 TEAM-BASED CHAOS</strong><br>Play <strong>2v2, 3v3 or 4v4</strong> \u2014 pure dwarven kitchen madness! Gather your crew, share the work\u2026 or just punch each other until something\u2019s cooked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/e576a410f6994abf32d2aed0920edc11.poster.avif?t=1768245375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/e576a410f6994abf32d2aed0920edc11.webm?t=1768245375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udf7b GOOFY COOKING &amp; BRAWLING<br>Punch rival chefs, fight while grilling meat and drinking ale and try to keep your tavern standing.<br>No rules, only chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>FAST-PACED KITCHEN BATTLES</strong><br>Race against time \u2014 don\u2019t let the rival tavern serve before you do! Victory takes strategy, reflexes, and a healthy dose of stupidity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/fd5b6f48648f84bf2692a85f4fde3898.poster.avif?t=1768245375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/fd5b6f48648f84bf2692a85f4fde3898.webm?t=1768245375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\uddc5 A Medieval Ale Evening</strong><br>Roaring fires, flying punches, and dancing\u2026 Just another night at the tavern!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/8101aced787647d9c568dbc61ba6ebee.poster.avif?t=1768245375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/8101aced787647d9c568dbc61ba6ebee.webm?t=1768245375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\uddc2 STRATEGY? MAYBE. CHAOS? DEFINITELY.</strong><br>Assign roles, follow recipes \u2014 or just hope someone finishes the dish before everything burns. \ud83d\ude05</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/ad31fe5ef35d5c5860eafb07144f7ed4.poster.avif?t=1768245375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/ad31fe5ef35d5c5860eafb07144f7ed4.webm?t=1768245375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f DAMNS, DRUNKS &amp; TAVERNS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Damn your rivals:</strong> Sabotage their kitchens, steal their supplies, twist their recipes and drive their customers insane!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Get drunk to grow stronger:</strong> Guzzle sacred ale, unlock drunken powers and turn your hangover into pure strength!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade your tavern</strong>: Buy sturdier tables, faster ovens, unbreakable pans and ridiculous medieval d\u00e9cor to rule the feast hall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf56 IN SHORT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 A medieval co-op cooking &amp; brawling game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 2\u20138 player online chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd4a Head-to-head tavern warfare filled with flying food and fists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Damn your rivals and ruin their kitchens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7a Get drunk to upgrade \u2014 the drunker you get, the stronger you fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2697\ufe0f Loud, messy and gloriously stupid!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086670?t=1768245375","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/174fca777065a5496e49df8ae5537b2b7ce6cd1f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768245375","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/1f1a89703e5cabe398e8f272e07f62fdc61ea659/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768245375","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/1f1a89703e5cabe398e8f272e07f62fdc61ea659/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768245375","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains alcohol use."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf7a DRUNK &amp; DAMNED</strong><br>The Wildest Medieval Cooking Brawl!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drunk &amp; Damned</strong> is a hilarious medieval cooking game where <strong>2\u20138</strong> players team up in chaotic <strong>co-op</strong>,<br>cook, brawl, and compete against rival taverns for beer-soaked glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two rival taverns.<br>Two chaotic kitchens.<br>And way too much ale. \ud83c\udf7b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your beards, swing your pans, and show everyone your crew can serve the meatiest, messiest meals in the kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf57 TEAM-BASED CHAOS</strong><br>Play <strong>2v2, 3v3 or 4v4</strong> \u2014 pure dwarven kitchen madness! Gather your crew, share the work\u2026 or just punch each other until something\u2019s cooked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/e576a410f6994abf32d2aed0920edc11.poster.avif?t=1768245375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/e576a410f6994abf32d2aed0920edc11.webm?t=1768245375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udf7b GOOFY COOKING &amp; BRAWLING<br>Punch rival chefs, fight while grilling meat and drinking ale and try to keep your tavern standing.<br>No rules, only chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>FAST-PACED KITCHEN BATTLES</strong><br>Race against time \u2014 don\u2019t let the rival tavern serve before you do! Victory takes strategy, reflexes, and a healthy dose of stupidity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/fd5b6f48648f84bf2692a85f4fde3898.poster.avif?t=1768245375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/fd5b6f48648f84bf2692a85f4fde3898.webm?t=1768245375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\uddc5 A Medieval Ale Evening</strong><br>Roaring fires, flying punches, and dancing\u2026 Just another night at the tavern!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/8101aced787647d9c568dbc61ba6ebee.poster.avif?t=1768245375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/8101aced787647d9c568dbc61ba6ebee.webm?t=1768245375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\uddc2 STRATEGY? MAYBE. CHAOS? DEFINITELY.</strong><br>Assign roles, follow recipes \u2014 or just hope someone finishes the dish before everything burns. \ud83d\ude05</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/ad31fe5ef35d5c5860eafb07144f7ed4.poster.avif?t=1768245375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/extras/ad31fe5ef35d5c5860eafb07144f7ed4.webm?t=1768245375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f DAMNS, DRUNKS &amp; TAVERNS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Damn your rivals:</strong> Sabotage their kitchens, steal their supplies, twist their recipes and drive their customers insane!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Get drunk to grow stronger:</strong> Guzzle sacred ale, unlock drunken powers and turn your hangover into pure strength!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade your tavern</strong>: Buy sturdier tables, faster ovens, unbreakable pans and ridiculous medieval d\u00e9cor to rule the feast hall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf56 IN SHORT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 A medieval co-op cooking &amp; brawling game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 2\u20138 player online chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd4a Head-to-head tavern warfare filled with flying food and fists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Damn your rivals and ruin their kitchens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7a Get drunk to upgrade \u2014 the drunker you get, the stronger you fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2697\ufe0f Loud, messy and gloriously stupid!</p></li></ul>","developers":["TadolakDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/a7cd76ca079745e846dffdc869ceaca78752d8e8/header.jpg?t=1768245375","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Drunk & Damned","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GT 730<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["TadolakDev"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas l\u00edcitas\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Alkohol / Tabak\nGewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/e50ff76b8108c197bfa07f37c33bd65eb3442a78/ss_e50ff76b8108c197bfa07f37c33bd65eb3442a78.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768245375","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/e50ff76b8108c197bfa07f37c33bd65eb3442a78/ss_e50ff76b8108c197bfa07f37c33bd65eb3442a78.600x338.jpg?t=1768245375"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086670/d22197ffdba00acd131db5f893c3335658c947e6/ss_d22197ffdba00acd131db5f893c3335658c947e6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1